Value MEM_PCT (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value TOTAL_MEM_BYTES (\d+)
Value USED_MEM_BYTES (\d+)

Start
  # Matches the percentage row, whether it's an integer or decimal
  ^\|\s*${MEM_PCT}\s*\|
  # Matches the bytes row and triggers the record save
  ^\|\s*${TOTAL_MEM_BYTES}\(B\)\s*\|\s*${USED_MEM_BYTES}\(B\).* -> Record